## PROJECT CONTEXT

We are continuing development of the existing BrainCode Academy platform.

**Product:** BrainCode Academy  
**Company:** BrainCode Technology Limited  
**Tagline:** Learn. Build. Innovate. Grow.

**Existing technology stack:**
- React 19
- Vite
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS v4
- Express
- WebSockets
